{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Web: Recommended Ad Size, Caching, CSS, Minify, Modus Operandi, and Progressive, and related topics.","label":"Web","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/software","label":"Software","url":"\/computer\/technology\/software"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on Web: Recommended Ad Size, Caching, CSS, Minify, Modus Operandi, and Progressive, and related topics.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Recommended Ad Size<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t{Wide}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Caching<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf the cache expires, the client requests with the ETag = fingerprint (as sent by the server in the past). The server checks the fingerprint and returns <code class='inline'>Not_modified<\/code> if not changed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>CSS<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCSS notes: finding unused rules with audit tools and PurifyCSS.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Minify<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/speed\/docs\/insights\/MinifyResources.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Modus Operandi<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDomain.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Progressive<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tToo many transparent pixels can cause icons not to work.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Responsive img<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>&lt;srcset&gt;<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>SEO<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSEO notes: titles, protocol display, and www.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Sitemap<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReference: http:\/\/www.sitemaps.org\/\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>SSL<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSL notes: Let's Encrypt issuance, JKS, testing, and renewal.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/ad_size' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/ad_size' data-title='Ad Size'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/web\/ad_size\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Ad Size<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/caching' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/caching' data-title='Caching'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/web\/caching\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Caching<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/css' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/css' data-title='CSS'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/technology\/web\/css.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/web\/css\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>CSS<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/minify' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/minify' data-title='Minify'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/web\/minify\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Minify<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/compu